{"version":1,"key":"card:135","content":{"id":135,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"GSAP 是一个动画库，引用官网的一段话","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f2b92ed7-4cf4-41d8-86aa-0ba995805375","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Animation ultimately boils down to changing property values many times per second, making something appear to move, fade, spin, etc.","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7714d368-e415-47d5-97d9-a33f23dbd720","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6823a492-51a8-4c2e-baa3-fef39ffa1768","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","type":"blockquote"},{"children":[{"text":"动画的实质就是在一秒内多次改变属性值，GSAP 就是做这个工作的，在给定起始值和终止值时，GSAP 可以在 1s 内做 60 次插值。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9b4566f0-2f66-4765-aee7-f3781123b884","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"GSAP 可以对以下属性进行插值：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cfff4c80-42a5-4a6e-8efd-9f846706f77c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"CSS 属性，例如 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"width","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"height","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"borderRadius","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"color","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b26562b4-a903-4105-83a4-3637dbacfc43","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9609b4d7-9be8-4c4f-b5f8-252d9e4af2bf","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"SVG 属性，例如 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"viewBox","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"stroke","type":"formatted"},{"text":", ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fill","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，可以通过额外的插件对路径进行变形动画","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"70db2da5-79ba-4030-b072-6ec78bc9cabf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1418a47e-d23f-464e-81b0-5b67a76c43bd","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"任何数值，GSAP 可以对任意对象中的数值属性进行插值","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c6bcf575-3b96-4e80-a91e-0d2bf8b36da8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9a61acad-3438-4076-9147-6c0dbe92e554","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"58ebf9e4-2115-430f-9951-1ed8ac8e1411","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["JavaScript/三方库/GSAP"],"createTime":1689489905013,"updateTime":1793532517876,"linkedCards":[{"id":136,"target":{"key":"card:136","type":"card","id":136},"summary":"在项目中使用 GSAP 通过 script 标签引入 CDN，然后就可以在代码中访问 gsap 了 <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.10.4/gsap.m...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/GSAP"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532517876}}